From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Martin Lund <mrlund@hotmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 17:17:51 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] drm/panel: oneplus-dodge: drive the AA569 panel in command
 mode

Stock runs this panel as "AA569 P 3 A0019 dsc cmd mode panel"
(qcom,mdss-dsi-panel-type = "dsi_cmd_mode") with TE on mdp_vsync. In
video burst mode the DPU never got a frame done. Drop the video mode
flags so msm sets up a command-mode interface.
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-aa569-p-3-a0019-dsc.c | 7 +++++--
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-aa569-p-3-a0019-dsc.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-aa569-p-3-a0019-dsc.c
index 7d519bdc2..2888762f1 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-aa569-p-3-a0019-dsc.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-aa569-p-3-a0019-dsc.c
@@ -402,8 +402,11 @@ static int panel_aa569_p_3_a0019_dsc_probe(struct mipi_dsi_device *dsi)
 
 	dsi->lanes = 4;
 	dsi->format = MIPI_DSI_FMT_RGB101010;
-	dsi->mode_flags = MIPI_DSI_MODE_VIDEO_BURST |
-			  MIPI_DSI_MODE_NO_EOT_PACKET |
+	/*
+	 * Stock drives this panel in DSC command mode
+	 * (qcom,mdss-dsi-panel-type = "dsi_cmd_mode") with TE on mdp_vsync.
+	 */
+	dsi->mode_flags = MIPI_DSI_MODE_NO_EOT_PACKET |
 			  MIPI_DSI_CLOCK_NON_CONTINUOUS;
 
 	ctx->panel.prepare_prev_first = true;
-- 
2.55.0

